1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
What if every day repeated, but you aged?

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,080
Same Tuesday, forever.

3
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:08,540
10,000 loops later, you're 27 years older, and nobody else is.

4
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:10,080
At first, it's a cheat code.

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,460
You learn piano, a new language, every answer on the test.

6
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,000
Nobody can explain how.

7
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:16,720
But your body keeps the receipts.

8
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:17,660
Gray hair.

9
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:18,500
Bad knees.

10
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:19,760
And here's the dark part.

11
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:22,560
Every morning, your mom wakes up expecting her kid…

12
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:24,180
and finds a stranger in your bed.

13
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:25,220
You explain it again.

14
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:26,140
She forgets again.

15
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:27,900
Next loop, she screams again.

16
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:28,780
Want to break the loop?

17
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:29,360
Subscribe.

18
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:31,300
Or don't, and watch this video again.

19
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:31,900
And again.
